      "content": "     1|# SignalCore - AI Intelligence Operating System\n     2|\n     3|## Overview\n     4|SignalCore is the brain infrastructure for adaptive AI agents, providing persistent memory, intelligent communication, and cognitive reasoning capabilities.\n     5|\n     6|## Project Structure\n     7|\n     8|### Core Systems (`/core/`)\n     9|- **`memory/`** - Multi-tier memory management (DragonflyDB, Redis, MongoDB, ClickHouse, Qdrant, PostgreSQL)\n    10|- **`communication/`** - Agent-to-agent messaging and HITL interfaces (NATS, RedPanda)\n    11|- **`cognitive/`** - AI reasoning, learning, and decision-making engines\n    12|- **`integration/`** - System orchestration and coordination\n    13|\n    14|### Infrastructure (`/infrastructure/`)\n    15|- **`databases/`** - Database configurations and connection management\n    16|- **`deployment/`** - Deployment scripts and containerization\n    17|- **`monitoring/`** - Health checks, metrics, and observability\n    18|\n    19|### Documentation (`/docs/`)\n    20|- **`architecture/`** - System design and technical specifications\n    21|- **`best-practices/`** - Development guidelines and standards\n    22|- **`guides/`** - User and developer documentation\n    23|- **`api/`** - API documentation and schemas\n    24|\n    25|### Testing (`/testing/`)\n    26|- **`unit/`** - Unit tests for core components\n    27|- **`integration/`** - End-to-end system tests\n    28|- **`performance/`** - Load and performance testing\n    29|\n    30|### Configuration (`/config/`)\n    31|- **`development/`** - Development environment settings\n    32|- **`staging/`** - Staging environment configuration\n    33|- **`production/`** - Production deployment settings\n    34|\n    35|### Scripts (`/scripts/`)\n    36|- **`deployment/`** - Deployment automation\n    37|- **`maintenance/`** - System maintenance utilities\n    38|- **`utilities/`** - General purpose scripts\n    39|\n    40|## Quick Start\n    41|\n    42|### Prerequisites\n    43|- Python 3.8+\n    44|- Redis/DragonflyDB\n    45|- MongoDB 7.0+\n    46|- PostgreSQL 14+\n    47|- ClickHouse\n    48|- Qdrant\n    49|- NATS\n    50|\n    51|### Installation\n    52|```bash\n    53|# Clone repository\n    54|git clone <repository-url>\n    55|cd signalcore\n    56|\n    57|# Install dependencies\n    58|pip install -r requirements.txt\n    59|\n    60|# Setup database connections\n    61|cp config/development/database.conf.example config/development/database.conf\n    62|\n    63|# Run tests\n    64|python -m pytest testing/\n    65|\n    66|# Start development server\n    67|python core/integration/signalcore_server.py\n    68|```\n    69|\n    70|## Development Guidelines\n    71|\n    72|### Code Standards\n    73|- Follow PEP 8 for Python code\n    74|- Use type hints for all function signatures\n    75|- Document all public APIs\n    76|- Write comprehensive tests for new features\n    77|\n    78|### Database Access\n    79|- Always use connection pooling\n    80|- Implement proper error handling\n    81|- Use parameterized queries\n    82|- Follow database-specific best practices\n    83|\n    84|### Memory Management\n    85|- Use appropriate TTL for different memory tiers\n    86|- Implement automatic cleanup procedures\n    87|- Monitor memory usage and performance\n    88|- Document memory usage patterns\n    89|\n    90|### Communication Protocols\n    91|- Standardize message formats\n    92|- Implement proper error handling\n    93|- Use async/await for I/O operations\n    94|- Monitor message throughput and latency\n    95|\n    96|## Contributing\n    97|\n    98|1. Create feature branch from `main`\n    99|2. Make changes with tests\n   100|3. Update documentation\n   101|4. Submit pull request\n   102|5. Code review required\n   103|6. Merge after approval\n   104|\n   105|## Security\n   106|\n   107|- All database connections use authentication\n   108|- Implement proper access controls\n   109|- Regular security audits\n   110|- Follow OWASP guidelines\n   111|\n   112|## Monitoring\n   113|\n   114|- Health check endpoints\n   115|- Performance metrics\n   116|- Error tracking\n   117|- System alerts\n   118|\n   119|## Support\n   120|\n   121|- Documentation: `/docs/`\n   122|- Issues: GitHub Issues\n   123|- Discussions: GitHub Discussions\n   124|- Email: support@adapt.ai\n   125|\n   126|---\n   127|\n   128|*SignalCore - Building the future of AI intelligence*",
