d status updates\n    60|\n    61|# Sprint Planning\n    62|n2n.team.sprint.planning\n    63|# Usage: Planning and coordination sessions\n    64|```\n    65|\n    66|---\n    67|\n    68|## 💬 STANDARD MESSAGE FORMAT\n    69|\n    70|### **Message Envelope**\n    71|```json\n    72|{\n    73|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n    74|  \"sender\": \"signalcore|dataops\",\n    75|  \"priority\": \"low|normal|high|critical\",\n    76|  \"channel_type\": \"request|response|status|alert\",\n    77|  \"message_id\": \"uuid-v7\",\n    78|  \"ttl_seconds\": 300,\n    79|  \"payload\": {\n    80|    \"subject\": \"Brief subject line\",\n    81|    \"body\": \"Detailed message content\",\n    82|    \"action_required\": true|false,\n    83|    \"deadline\": \"2025-11-21T11:00:00Z\",\n    84|    \"context\": \"Integration technical details\"\n    85|  }\n    86|}\n    87|```\n    88|\n    89|---\n    90|\n    91|## 🎯 IMMEDIATE USE CASES\n    92|\n    93|### **1. Infrastructure Access Request**\n    94|```bash\n    95|# SignalCore needs database connections\n    96|nats pub n2n.dataops.database.access '{\n    97|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n    98|  \"sender\": \"signalcore\",\n    99|  \"priority\": \"high\",\n   100|  \"channel_type\": \"request\",\n   101|  \"payload\": {\n   102|    \"subject\": \"Database Connection Setup for SignalCore\",\n   103|    \"body\": \"Need connections to all 6 databases for memory system integration\",\n   104|    \"action_required\": true,\n   105|    \"deadline\": \"2025-11-21T10:00:00Z\",\n   106|    \"database_requirements\": {\n   107|      \"dragonfly\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18000, \"auth\": true},\n   108|      \"redis\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18010, \"cluster\": true},\n   109|      \"mongodb\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18070},\n   110|      \"clickhouse\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18090},\n   111|      \"qdrant\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18050},\n   112|      \"postgresql\": {\"host\": \"localhost\", \"port\": 18030}\n   113|    }\n   114|  }\n   115|}'\n   116|```\n   117|\n   118|### **2. Performance Requirements**\n   119|```bash\n   120|# SignalCore defines latency requirements\n   121|nats pub n2n.dataops.performance.requirements '{\n   122|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n   123|  \"sender\": \"signalcore\", \n   124|  \"priority\": \"high\",\n   125|  \"channel_type\": \"request\",\n   126|  \"payload\": {\n   127|    \"subject\": \"Performance Requirements for 48-Hour Timeline\",\n   128|    \"body\": \"Aggressive performance requirements for AI-speed integration\",\n   129|    \"requirements\": {\n   130|      \"dragonfly_memory\": {\"latency_ms\": 5, \"throughput_ops_per_sec\": 10000},\n   131|      \"nats_messaging\": {\"latency_ms\": 1, \"throughput_msgs_per_sec\": 50000},\n   132|      \"cross_database_search\": {\"latency_ms\": 50, \"max_concurrent\": 100}\n   133|    }\n   134|  }\n   135|}'\n   136|```\n   137|\n   138|### **3. Infrastructure Health Monitoring**\n   139|```bash\n   140|# DataOps provides health updates\n   141|nats pub n2n.signalcore.infrastructure.health '{\n   142|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n   143|  \"sender\": \"dataops\",\n   144|  \"priority\": \"normal\",\n   145|  \"channel_type\": \"status\",\n   146|  \"payload\": {\n   147|    \"subject\": \"Infrastructure Health Report\",\n   148|    \"body\": \"All 19 services operational, ready for SignalCore integration\",\n   149|    \"health_metrics\": {\n   150|      \"total_services\": 19,\n   151|      \"operational\": 16,\n   152|      \"warning\": 3,\n   153|      \"failed\": 0,\n   154|      \"health_percentage\": 84\n   155|    }\n   156|  }\n   157|}'\n   158|```\n   159|\n   160|---\n   161|\n   162|## ⚡ EMERGENCY PROTOCOLS\n   163|\n   164|### **Critical Issue Escalation**\n   165|```bash\n   166|# Immediate escalation for critical issues\n   167|nats pub n2n.emergency.escalation '{\n   168|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n   169|  \"sender\": \"signalcore\",\n   170|  \"priority\": \"critical\",\n   171|  \"channel_type\": \"alert\",\n   172|  \"payload\": {\n   173|    \"subject\": \"CRITICAL: Infrastructure Issue\",\n   174|    \"body\": \"Database connection failure affecting Phoenix timeline\",\n   175|    \"impact\": \"blocking_signalcore_integration\",\n   176|    \"action_required\": true,\n   177|    \"escalation_level\": \"immediate\"\n   178|  }\n   179|}'\n   180|```\n   181|\n   182|---\n   183|\n   184|## 📊 RESPONSE TIME EXPECTATIONS\n   185|\n   186|### **SLA for 48-Hour Timeline**\n   187|- **Critical Issues**: < 5 minutes response\n   188|- **High Priority**: < 15 minutes response  \n   189|- **Normal Priority**: < 1 hour response\n   190|- **Status Updates**: Real-time via NATS\n   191|\n   192|---\n   193|\n   194|## 🔄 AUTOMATED COORDINATION\n   195|\n   196|### **Daily Standup Automation**\n   197|```bash\n   198|# Morning standup trigger\n   199|0 9 * * 1-7 nats pub n2n.team.standup.coordination '{\n   200|  \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-21T09:00:00Z\",\n   201|  \"sender\": \"signalcore\",\n   202|  \"priority\": \"normal\", \n   203|  \"channel_type\": \"status\",\n   204|  \"payload\": {\n   205|    \"subject\": \"Daily Phoenix Integration Standup\",\n   206|    \"body\": \"SignalCore ready for infrastructure integration\",\n   207|    \"status\": \"ready_for_integration\",\n   208|    \"blockers\": \"none\"\n   209|  }\n   210|}'\n   211|```\n   212|\n   213|---\n   214|\n   215|**Communication Protocol Active. Ready for real-time coordination at AI speed.**",
